| Notebook | Description | GPU needed? |
|---|---|---|
| `01_algorithm_overview.ipynb` | Math and synthetic demo | ❌ No |
| `02_san_francisco.ipynb` | Full SF workflow | ✅ Yes |
| `03_florence_advanced.ipynb` | Exclusionary zones, incremental | ✅ Yes |

